   <dmdSec ID="DMD_11449_321606">
      <mdWrap MDTYPE="MODS">
         <xmlData xmlns:mods="http://www.loc.gov/mods/v3" xsi:schemaLocation="http://www.loc.gov/mods/v3 http://www.loc.gov/standards/mods/v3/mods-3-1.xsd">
            <mods:mods xsi:schemaLocation="http://www.loc.gov/mods/v3 http://www.loc.gov/standards/mods/v3/mods-3-1.xsd">
               <mods:name>
                  <mods:role>
                     <mods:roleTerm type="text">advisor</mods:roleTerm>
                  </mods:role>
                  <mods:namePart>Chang, Hung Kiang </mods:namePart>
               </mods:name>
               <mods:name>
                  <mods:role>
                     <mods:roleTerm type="text">author</mods:roleTerm>
                  </mods:role>
                  <mods:namePart>Cunha, Caroline Favoreto da </mods:namePart>
               </mods:name>
               <mods:name>
                  <mods:role>
                     <mods:roleTerm type="text">institution</mods:roleTerm>
                  </mods:role>
                  <mods:namePart>Universidade Estadual Paulista (Unesp)</mods:namePart>
               </mods:name>
               <mods:name>
                  <mods:role>
                     <mods:roleTerm type="text">committeeMember</mods:roleTerm>
                  </mods:role>
                  <mods:namePart>Chang, Hung Kiang </mods:namePart>
               </mods:name>
               <mods:name>
                  <mods:role>
                     <mods:roleTerm type="text">committeeMember</mods:roleTerm>
                  </mods:role>
                  <mods:namePart>Alberto, Marcio Costa</mods:namePart>
               </mods:name>
               <mods:name>
                  <mods:role>
                     <mods:roleTerm type="text">committeeMember</mods:roleTerm>
                  </mods:role>
                  <mods:namePart>Gonçalves, Roger Dias</mods:namePart>
               </mods:name>
               <mods:extension>
                  <mods:dateAccessioned encoding="iso8601">2026-04-13T12:27:37Z</mods:dateAccessioned>
               </mods:extension>
               <mods:originInfo>
                  <mods:dateIssued encoding="iso8601">2026-03-11</mods:dateIssued>
               </mods:originInfo>
               <mods:identifier type="citation">CUNHA, Caroline Favoreto da. Modelo hidrogeológico conceitual e numérico da Bacia Hidrográfica do Ribeirão Pirapitingui, Itu-SP. 2026. Dissertação (Mestrado em Geociências e Meio Ambiente) – Instituto de Geociências e Ciências Exatas, Universidade Estadual Paulista (UNESP), Rio Claro, 2026.</mods:identifier>
               <mods:identifier type="uri">https://hdl.handle.net/11449/321606</mods:identifier>
               <mods:identifier type="capes">33004137036P9</mods:identifier>
               <mods:identifier type="lattes">198966245924483819896624592448380699975185726480</mods:identifier>
               <mods:identifier type="orcid">0000-0002-6274-45100000-0003-4122-54280000-0002-6274-4510</mods:identifier>
               <mods:abstract>A pressão crescente sobre os recursos hídricos subterrâneos em áreas urbanizadas torna fundamental a compreensão do funcionamento dos sistemas aquíferos para subsidiar sua gestão sustentável. Este trabalho desenvolveu um modelo hidrogeológico conceitual e numérico da Bacia do Ribeirão Pirapitingui, em Itu – SP, com o objetivo de compreender a dinâmica do fluxo subterrâneo e estimar a disponibilidade hídrica regional. O modelo conceitual foi elaborado a partir da integração de dados geológicos, geomorfológicos, hidrológicos e hidrogeológicos, identificando o Aquífero Itararé e o Aquífero Cristalino, compartimentado em zonas saprolítica, fraturada e de rocha sã. Com base no modelo conceitual, foi construído um modelo numérico de fluxo no software FEFLOW. O modelo foi calibrado em regimes permanente e transiente, reproduzindo satisfatoriamente níveis piezométricos, gradientes hidráulicos e vazões de base. Os resultados indicaram reserva hídrica subterrânea drenável da ordem de 1,51 × 10⁸ m³ e demonstraram que o fluxo regional é controlado principalmente pelo Aquífero Itararé e pelos saprólitos do embasamento cristalino. O modelo forneceu uma representação consistente do sistema aquífero, contribuindo para a avaliação da disponibilidade hídrica e o suporte à gestão dos recursos hídricos subterrâneos em Itu – SP.</mods:abstract>
               <mods:abstract>The increasing pressure on groundwater resources in urbanized areas makes it essential to understand the functioning of aquifer systems in order to support sustainable water resources management. This study developed a conceptual and numerical hydrogeological model of the Ribeirão Pirapitingui Basin, located in Itu, São Paulo State, Brazil, with the objective of understanding groundwater flow dynamics and estimating regional water availability. The conceptual model was constructed through the integration of geological, geomorphological, hydrological, and hydrogeological data, identifying the Itararé Aquifer and the Crystalline Aquifer, subdivided into saprolitic, fractured, and fresh rock zones. Based on the conceptual framework, a numerical groundwater flow model was implemented using the FEFLOW software. The model was calibrated under steady-state and transient conditions, satisfactorily reproducing piezometric levels, hydraulic gradients, and baseflow rates. The results indicate a drainable groundwater reserve on the order of 1.51 × 10⁸ m³ and demonstrate that regional groundwater flow is primarily controlled by the Itararé Aquifer and the saprolitic zones of the crystalline basement. The model provides a consistent representation of the aquifer system, contributing to the assessment of groundwater availability and supporting the management of groundwater resources in Itu, São Paulo State.</mods:abstract>
               <mods:language>
                  <mods:languageTerm authority="rfc3066">por</mods:languageTerm>
               </mods:language>
               <mods:accessCondition type="useAndReproduction"/>
               <mods:subject>
                  <mods:topic>Modelo hidrogeológico conceitual</mods:topic>
               </mods:subject>
               <mods:subject>
                  <mods:topic>Modelo numérico de fluxo</mods:topic>
               </mods:subject>
               <mods:subject>
                  <mods:topic>Aquífero Itararé</mods:topic>
               </mods:subject>
               <mods:subject>
                  <mods:topic>Aquífero cristalino</mods:topic>
               </mods:subject>
               <mods:subject>
                  <mods:topic>FEFLOW</mods:topic>
               </mods:subject>
               <mods:titleInfo>
                  <mods:title>Modelo hidrogeológico conceitual e numérico da Bacia Hidrográfica do Ribeirão Pirapitingui, Itu-SP</mods:title>
               </mods:titleInfo>
               <mods:genre>Dissertação de mestrado</mods:genre>
            </mods:mods>
         </xmlData>
      </mdWrap>
   </dmdSec>
